5</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">년 헝가리 정부 초청 장학생</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">』</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">선발 접수 마감 연장을 안내하오니</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">관심있는 학생들의 많은 참여 바랍니다</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 7pt; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">가</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">. </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">선발 인원 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">: </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">프로그램별 약간 명</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-INDENT: -73.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; MARGIN-LEFT: 76.6pt; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold\" lang=\"EN-US\"></span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">※ </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">Stipendium Hungaricum </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">프로그램은 헝가리 정부와 양자협정을 맺은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">28</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">개국 학생만 지원 가능</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">, </span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">총 선발인원은 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">2,000</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">명이며 한국 학생은 지원자 수에 따라 다르겠지만 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 맑은 고딕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">100</span><span style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕\">명 이내 선발 예정임</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-TOP: 3pt; TEXT-INDENT: 3.3pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\" class=\"0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; FON